    "manas-2010:p0896:b001:l005": "Youngest of six lions addresses Manas before the address turns to Ajybay; source shift retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0896:b001:l015": "Багалак = variant of багалек, trouser cuffs, not fetlock. Yudakhin quotes trimming cuffs with whole otter skin, matching preceding lines13–14. https://el-sozduk.kg/багалек/",
    "manas-2010:p0896:b001:l016": "Чатыраш is chess, confirmed by primary dictionary. https://el-sozduk.kg/чаты/",
    "manas-2010:p0896:b001:l038": "Тоонун теңиндей read as equal to a mountain in size; not an exact half-mountain measurement.",
    "manas-2010:p0897:b001:l010": "Күң literally bondwoman/maid, used here in praise of the princely girl. Girl avoids asserting a verified enslaved legal status; the servile term remains a source nuance.",
    "manas-2010:p0897:b001:l032": "Grass upon tracks in32–35 is retained as the pursuit image; exact idiomatic force is uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0897:b001:l036": "Bakay is named here before the subsequent flight narrative featuring Chubak and Kögala. The implicit subject shift is not silently regularized.",
    "manas-2010:p0898:b001:l033": "Ten circuits is the printed hyperbolic count.",
    "manas-2010:p0899:b001:l002": "Күрөөкө is the protective coat; specific construction is not established in this line.",
    "manas-2010:p0899:b001:l022": "The object of taking six is elliptical; six cities or sieges is not supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p0899:b001:l029": "Image prints Бурар, retained as Burar. Probably a variant or defect for nearby Букар/Bukhara; no separate modern location asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p0899:b001:l033": "Temirkan is retained beside the Karakan father-formula elsewhere; no harmonization of names.",
    "manas-2010:p0900:b001:l024": "Image reads көзүмүн, I am the eye, not өзүмүн. Rendered as Bakay’s appositional watchful-eye image; compare914:42–915:1. Raw is not emended.",
    "manas-2010:p0900:b001:l033": "Mare’s milk by day and girls by night preserves the stated contrast without adding specific sexual conduct.",
    "manas-2010:p0900:b001:l038": "Printed күрдөңдү interpreted via күрдөөн hardship/torment, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/күрдөө/. Same edition162:41 күрдөөндү тапчу;264:33,457:26,625:14 күрдөөңдү табар/тапчу;624:31 чечер;932:2 күрдөңдү жазар support an adviser discerning/relieving troubles. Spelling and exact idiom remain provisional; merriment is unsupported.",
    "manas-2010:p0901:b001:l010": "Тоонун теңиндей repeats the mountain-sized simile.",
    "manas-2010:p0901:b001:l030": "Chewing white wheat flour belongs to the oath of friendship, not infant feeding.",
    "manas-2010:p0901:b001:l031": "Manas encyclopedia and2015 dictionary identify келеме шарып as the Quran, and кармоо as swearing upon it, often paired with chewing white wheat flour: https://el-sozduk.kg/келеме/. Earlier generic Holy Word/profession of faith revised to this contextual Quran oath; raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0901:b001:l034": "Antelope hair and kneading flour in34–37 are compressed oath/bond images; exact gesture uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0901:b001:l038": "Four groups of stars retained without assigning a modern constellation.",
    "manas-2010:p0901:b001:l042": "Чампаң read with edition glossary1843:b001:l029 Чампан: people whose language is unintelligible. No verified tribe called Champang asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p0902:b001:l030": "Менде read as пенде, mortal, in this battle formula, not with me.",
    "manas-2010:p0902:b001:l038": "Өгөө file and бүлөө whetstone retained in the gift/substitution formula.",
    "manas-2010:p0902:b001:l039": "Two and one have no explicit objects in this display row; none invented.",
    "manas-2010:p0903:b001:l009": "Single self becoming five is the literal joy/support hyperbole.",
    "manas-2010:p0903:b001:l019": "Бир арак does not establish a modern unit of alcohol; flask context retained without invented volume.",
    "manas-2010:p0903:b001:l023": "Уйбаш is the cow-head size comparison for the wooden bowl.",
    "manas-2010:p0903:b001:l038": "Red spear and Zulpukor are juxtaposed before drawing from a sheath; the shared syntax is preserved despite the spear’s incongruity.",
    "manas-2010:p0904:b001:l013": "Lines13–16 retain the character’s distinction between verbal and forced submission, not a translator endorsement.",
    "manas-2010:p0905:b001:l006": "Animal comparison is Chubak’s derogatory judgment of the Noygut, not the translator’s assessment.",
    "manas-2010:p0905:b001:l016": "Argyn is explicitly printed even though this narrative concerns the Noygut; no ethnic-name substitution.",
    "manas-2010:p0905:b001:l025": "Lost their heads to the infidels is contextual causative interpretation of капырлардан баш кетип; exact syntax is compressed.",
    "manas-2010:p0905:b001:l030": "Heroes only within their village interprets айылга жакшы ironically in Chubak’s criticism.",
    "manas-2010:p0905:b001:l035": "Ten and, at39, three lack explicit objects; cities or victims not invented.",
    "manas-2010:p0905:b001:l037": "Contextually retranslated from the complete formula Ордолуу шайык көк жөкөр. Primary 1960 Semetey glossary PDF374 explicitly identifies it as an epithet of Kokand: great/holy/famous city and capital inhabited by many sheikhs. The complete formula, source image and adjacent Kyrgyz verses were individually reviewed; ordinary жөкөр dictionary footwear/retainer senses do not govern this geographic formula. Original raw text, IDs, coordinates and source lineation remain unchanged. Formula falls in military itinerary between Afghanistan and Kokon/Margalang/Samarkand; city epithet.",
    "manas-2010:p0906:b001:l006": "The printed age is no more than fourteen. No adult age substituted in this marriage narrative.",
    "manas-2010:p0906:b001:l013": "If I lie supplies the conventional elliptical condition of the oath буюрбасын; the thing to be denied is unspecified.",
    "manas-2010:p0906:b001:l020": "Kanykey stands and Chubak strikes in this line; she strikes him later at907:26.",
    "manas-2010:p0906:b001:l021": "Ringing sounds and her indifference are retained without inventing an armor material.",
    "manas-2010:p0906:b001:l023": "Trouser-hem comparison is the literal image of disdain.",
    "manas-2010:p0906:b001:l030": "Бааша = sovereign, not divinity, in the praise of Kanykey.",
    "manas-2010:p0906:b001:l036": "Кейисе read provisionally in the grief/anger sense; exact relation to the claim that no such person can be found remains uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0907:b001:l003": "Naked child is the visionary guardian figure, without sexual implication.",
    "manas-2010:p0907:b001:l005": "Кадыр түн is the sacred Night of Power; the compressed relation between the vision and night is not expanded into an invented episode.",
    "manas-2010:p0907:b001:l008": "Күң literally maid/bondwoman; rendered girl in princely bride-praise, with legal status uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0907:b001:l011": "Relative line precedes the identification of Chubak’s words at12; order retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0907:b001:l039": "Blue Naiman star retained as the printed astral name; no modern constellation identification asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p0908:b001:l013": "Олоң is a girth strap; hair simile retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0908:b001:l016": "Алеңгир жаа read as a deadly bow and сыр жебе smooth arrows, following the established primary-dictionary weapon senses.",
    "manas-2010:p0908:b001:l019": "Drawing the line is retained literally as a threat; its precise outcome is not supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p0908:b001:l026": "Infidel epithet is printed although906:11 calls Kanykey radiant among Muslims; contradiction retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0909:b001:l002": "Image prints арга, not нарга. Explicit conjectural restoration of dropped н: loading gold on eighty camels. Same edition576:32,930:41,950:38,958:30 all read Сексен төөгө дилде артып; 2015 dictionary quotes that formula followed by Temirkan. https://el-sozduk.kg/dilde-6/. Raw unchanged; not claimed as a verified printed correction.",
    "manas-2010:p0909:b001:l007": "Placing earrings is the betrothal action in the marriage-alliance context.",
    "manas-2010:p0909:b001:l009": "Ар provisionally honor, beside wealth; exact gift-formula nuance uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0909:b001:l013": "Уз is a skilled craftswoman; not merely physical beauty.",
    "manas-2010:p0909:b001:l035": "Mediyen retained as the named desert, without modern geographic identification. Context describes empty country but does not independently establish unpeopled as its lexical meaning.",
    "manas-2010:p0909:b001:l041": "Кескелдирик = lizard in Yudakhin/2015 dictionaries, not a short sword. Desert fauna image resumes after the heroes’ amusement; agency of following салып жүр is compressed. https://el-sozduk.kg/КЕСКЕЛДИРИК%20/",
    "manas-2010:p0910:b001:l003": "Кутпа жак = north, established edition glossary; not substituted with prayer direction.",
    "manas-2010:p0910:b001:l014": "Асый is animal tooth-age reckoning. Fortieth tooth-year preserves the hyperbole without exact calendar-age conversion.",
    "manas-2010:p0910:b001:l016": "Buraq is the mythic mount designation; no ordinary breed supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p0910:b001:l023": "Broad-humped camel here and split-humped camel911:40 are both retained; no zoological harmonization.",
    "manas-2010:p0910:b001:l031": "Сандыргалуу = stately/renowned, primary Yudakhin and2015, not carrying a rattle. https://el-sozduk.kg/сандырга/",
    "manas-2010:p0911:b001:l034": "Zhelkaiyp is the named progenitor; exact supernatural genealogy not expanded.",
    "manas-2010:p0911:b001:l041": "Атыштым visibly means exchanged shots; not silently changed to raced despite the following camel-swiftness lines.",
    "manas-2010:p0912:b001:l002": "Image prints алтын окто бара. Halter provisionally restores нокто from окто in the camel-head context; final бара read as expanded бар. Raw unchanged, conjecture explicit.",
    "manas-2010:p0912:b001:l012": "Мураапы: edition glossary1841:b001:l011 мурасчы, жөлөк-таяк. Helper in this camel-support context, not irrigation official.",
    "manas-2010:p0912:b001:l015": "Five corners of Mediyen retained beside the world’s four corners; no numerical harmonization.",
    "manas-2010:p0912:b001:l024": "Айт-кайт messaging interpretation follows the letters/delivery context in25–27; exact appointment phrase is provisional.",
    "manas-2010:p0912:b001:l032": "Мураа is the faithful companion/support sense, not an untranslated common noun.",
    "manas-2010:p0913:b001:l012": "Ит intensifies the torrent’s fierceness; no literal dogs added.",
    "manas-2010:p0913:b001:l027": "Khizir is the named sacred helper; touched by preserves чалган without inventing a separate apparition.",
    "manas-2010:p0913:b001:l030": "Mediyen retained as an epic place-name without modern identification.",
    "manas-2010:p0914:b001:l016": "Бут weight unit = Russian pood; historical measure retained without modern conversion. Primary discussion cites epic буттап алтын: https://base.oshsu.kg/univer/temp/url/ilim/2017-3.pdf",
    "manas-2010:p0914:b001:l017": "Күлазык = dried travel provisions; not literal ash-food.",
    "manas-2010:p0914:b001:l040": "Spoken of yet beyond sight preserves the supernatural figure’s compressed self-description.",
    "manas-2010:p0915:b001:l017": "Диниңди visibly faith; not silently replaced with self or fame.",
    "manas-2010:p0915:b001:l029": "Аңкоо guileless and ала көөдөн openhearted also carry naive/impulsive connotations; praise does not erase that nuance.",
    "manas-2010:p0915:b001:l031": "Арбак rendered ancestral spirit rather than generic courage.",
    "manas-2010:p0915:b001:l041": "Sky-sized gray horse preserves the explicit vastness simile."
  },
